From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wuming <eva2show@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 08:03:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] desktop: brand copy from brand.ts

The Desktop shell's menu, dialog and welcome copy, and the account settings and onboarding copy, take the product name, account provider and account name, and the welcome tagline from a brand.ts data module next to them. The shipped files hold the official copy, so the default build is unchanged; a rebranded build replaces both brand.ts files. An official client build titles its window with DSH_DESKTOP_PRODUCT_NAME when it is set.

